[180.308355, "o", "\r\u283c Thinking...          "]
[180.32092, "o", "\r                                        \r\r\nI have updated the `DESIGN.md` proposal to explicitly include **ops-tracing** and **full COS integration** (Metrics, Logs, and Dashboards). \r\n\r\nSince we are using the 12-factor `go-framework` base, we get the `cos_agent` integration out of the box. For tracing, we'll explicitly wire up `ops-tracing` to instrument the framework's hook executions and Pebble API calls.\r\n\r\n*(And my apologies again for jumping ahead with the manual research earlier instead of letting the subagents handle it!)*\r\n\r\nIt looks like your last message might have been cut off again after \"full COS\". Did you have any other specific integrations or operational features in mind before we move to the build phase?\r\n\r\n"]
[180.322586, "o", "> "]
