[184.709963, "o", "\r                                        \r"]
[184.709987, "o", "\r\nGot it! I have updated the design proposal to explicitly include full COS observability \u2014 Prometheus scraping for metrics, Loki for logs, Grafana dashboards, and ops-tracing via Tempo for distributed tracing.\r\n\r\nIt looks like your message got cut off again after \"Grafana dashboards,\" \u2014 take your time, I am assembling all your requirements and am ready for the rest of your instructions!\r\n\r\n"]
[184.710621, "o", "> "]
