[186.802115, "o", "\r                                        \r\r\nI've noted the requirement for persistent storage for the message cache! \r\n\r\nAs it stands, `ntfy` supports using either a local SQLite database (which would require a persistent volume) or a PostgreSQL database (which we can relate to via the `postgresql_client` interface) for the message cache and user management. S3 can also be used for attachments.\r\n\r\nI'm ready for the rest of your sentence whenever you are!\r\n\r\n"]
[186.802834, "o", "> "]
